    "title": "City of Chico to hand out seven day notices to homeless people camping in Lindo Channel - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Will Anderson ,\n3 hours ago CHICO, Calif. - The City of Chico has announced the next areas that will be subject to enforcement of anti-camping ordinances and planned closure of public property. On Wednesday, the City of Chico issued the notice to the Legal Services of Northern California (LSNC) of the city's planned closure of public property and anti-camping enforcement pursuant to Paragraph 10(c) of the Warren v. City of Chico Homeless Settlement Agreement. Read full article",
